<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenian reserves up $53.2 mln in March.</title>
<headline>Slovenian reserves up $53.2 mln in March.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Slovenia reported the following economic indicator details on Tuesday.</p>
<p>FOREIGN EXCHANGE RESERVES</p>
<p>    (in millions of dollars)     March	 Feb	March  96</p>
<p>    Total reserves		 3,933.4    3,880.2     3,378.3</p>
<p>    Bank of Slovenia reserves  2,455.8    2,431.8     1,538.8</p>
<p>NOTE: Total reserves are those held by the banking sector as whole.</p>
<p>-- Novica Mihajlovic, Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-8439</p>
</text>
